                "comment": "Professor Li is one of the best professor I have had at UW. I've taken two of her classes, even though I don't specialize in Chinese art history. She is so knowledgable and every lecture is a treat!",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Professor Li's lectures are very intriguing and educational. At every lecture, you'll learn something new. Her lectures can get a bit boring but she is values all the students' opinions and thoughts. She really cares about your grade and your work so make sure to participate and ask her questions. ",
